      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "NOTE: IF YOU HAVE DOWNLOADED A PROGRAM CALLED HAMACHI, it changed your TCP configuration, meaning you're download speed has been nerfed to 1.3 mbps. Using a static IP address whilst having TCP auto-tuning to disabled horrendously reduces your download speed.\nYou can check for issues by typing:\nnetsh interface tcp show global\ninto the command prompt, if auto-tuning level is set to DISABLED, type:\nnetsh interface tcp set global autotuninglevel=normal\nThat should solve the issue.\nI hope this helps!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
